      <div><a name="_c6e4d57f-5b79-c3b8-af21-8a6fde011900" id="_c6e4d57f-5b79-c3b8-af21-8a6fde011900"></a><h2>12.7<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>S102_DatasetDiscoveryMetadata</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_874fa901-c77e-31ad-7e08-3bc7604c09f6" id="_874fa901-c77e-31ad-7e08-3bc7604c09f6"></a>Dataset discovery metadata in S-102 is an extension of the generic S-100 metadata class S100_DatasetDiscoveryMetadata. S-102 adds the attribute <i>griddingMethod</i> which describes the algorithm used to calculate grid values. S-102 also restricts certain attributes and roles as described in <a href="#tab-s102-datasetDiscoveryMetadata-params">Table 12-10</a>.</p>

