<div><a name="_68981808-b57e-f3d4-937f-3efea5653a5a" id="_68981808-b57e-f3d4-937f-3efea5653a5a"></a><h3>12.7.5<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>S100_DataFormat</h3>

