owtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_788c78f0-af64-c507-03b4-68fcdbc58cd1" id="_788c78f0-af64-c507-03b4-68fcdbc58cd1"></a>Class</p>
