</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d3c40801-d158-0b66-da6a-b8131acebba9" id="_d3c40801-d158-0b66-da6a-b8131acebba9"></a>Class for S-102 catalogue metadata</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="center" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: center;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_63f80643-9645-d87c-80e2-52fe1a6de4b4" id="_63f80643-9645-d87c-80e2-52fe1a6de4b4"></a>-</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4bd1bbd4-6aa7-9c29-f6d0-253eaa4d39ac" id="_4bd1bbd4-6aa7-9c29-f6d0-253eaa4d39ac"></a>-</p>
